
tags are derived based on the behaviour
1) block level elements-
-------------------------
are the elements which occupies total space and always start on
a newline 
ex: div,p,table,form

div 
---
division element that is used group the elements for applying styles 

2)Inline elements
------------------
are the elements whichtakes neccessary space and doesn't start on 
a newline 
ex: span,a,img,input 

span 
span element is used to group the text for applying styles 

forms 
=====
it is used to collect  the information from the user and allowing 
user to submit the data to the server 
-> login,resgister,contact,crud operations

forms are defined with form tag
form textfields are defined with input tag
label tag is used provide the hint about the input tag

Attributes
----------
type it is used  control the text field 
type='text'
type='number'

placeholder
-----------
it provides the hint about the input to user 

for and id 
-----------
it is used  link the input to label

name 
----
it is used to carry the data to the backend as key 

formsaction
-----------
form action=""
action- it specifies where the 


